WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.200
Are you a SE that types 60 chars/minute

00:05.000 --> 00:08.720
or navigating within code with a mouse?

00:08.720 --> 00:13.040
you are likely a bad software engineer 

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
please do not believe to all the influencers 

00:16.040 --> 00:18.000
that will say you that typing

00:18.040 --> 00:21.000
is much less important than thinking 

00:21.000 --> 00:22.540
DEFINITELY, but 

00:22.540 --> 00:25.960
take a look on any BIG open source repo

00:26.000 --> 00:28.960
they have millions lines of code

00:28.960 --> 00:32.320
tensorflow, ffmpeg, etc **millions**

00:32.320 --> 00:35.320
and somebody. YOU. Need to read it, 

00:35.320 --> 00:38.320
navigate through it and make changes

00:38.320 --> 00:41.880
and if you cannot type and represent

00:41.320 --> 00:45.500
your thoughts quickly inside your editor 

00:45.500 --> 00:49.760
then you are not productive enough

00:48.880 --> 00:59.760
that's a rule

